<title>APES Puffer Party</title>
<style>
:root{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;color:#eafaff;background:#061b2c;color-scheme:dark}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top,#154f63,#061b2c 70%)}
main{max-width:1080px;margin:auto;padding:24px 18px 45px}
header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;margin-bottom:22px}
h1{font-size:clamp(29px,5vw,44px);letter-spacing:-1.5px;margin:3px 0}h2{margin:0 0 15px}
p{color:#bad5df;line-height:1.6}.tag{text-transform:uppercase;color:#79ebce;letter-spacing:2.6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800}
.pill{display:inline-block;border:1px solid #39647a;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:30px;color:#c5e2ec;font-size:12px}
.card{background:#103045;border:1px solid #2b5469;padding:24px;border-radius:22px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:18px}
.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.spread{justify-content:space-between}
label{display:block;font-size:14px;margin:15px 0 7px;color:#c5dfe8}
input,textarea,select{width:100%;background:#082436;border:1px solid #3c667b;color:white;border-radius:11px;padding:12px 14px;font:inherit}
input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{outline:2px solid #77eacf;outline-offset:2px}
textarea{min-height:125px;resize:vertical}
button{background:#78ecd0;color:#062e32;border:0;border-radius:11px;padding:13px 19px;font:inherit;font-weight:750;cursor:pointer}
button:hover{filter:brightness(1.1)}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}
.secondary{background:#234d64;color:#e6f7ff}.danger{background:#60394b;color:#ffe8ef}
.full{width:100%;margin-top:20px}.hidden{display:none!important}.help{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.fine{font-size:12px;color:#96b6c6}
ol{color:#c8e1ea;line-height:1.9;padding-left:22px}
.hero{font-size:78px;text-align:center;background:#0b293c;border-radius:17px;padding:25px;position:relative}
.hero span{display:inline-block;animation:bob 2.1s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes bob{50%{transform:translateY(-7px) rotate(4deg)}}
.arena{margin:16px 0 18px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 30%,#155d70,#08283f 75%);border:1px solid #315d73;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden}
svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
.station rect{fill:#103b50;stroke:#42677c;stroke-width:1.5;transition:fill .25s,stroke .25s}
.station.active rect{fill:#225e60;stroke:#92f7d6;stroke-width:3}
.station.out{opacity:.3}.station .teamname{fill:#f0fcff;font-size:15px;font-weight:750}
.station .stats{fill:#adcddb;font-size:11px}
.station.active .teamname{fill:#a0ffe0}
#pufferFloat{animation:bob 1.15s ease-in-out infinite;transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:center}
#inflate{transition:transform .1s}
#puffer.shaking #pufferFloat{animation:shake .12s infinite}
@keyframes shake{0%,100%{transform:rotate(-7deg)}50%{transform:rotate(7deg)}}
.bubble{animation:scatter .85s ease-out forwards}
@keyframes scatter{to{transform:translate(var(--dx),var(--dy)) scale(.15);opacity:0}}
.popword{animation:popword .85s ease-out forwards;transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:center;fill:#fff1a4;font-size:43px;font-weight:950;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#133b51;stroke-width:6}
@keyframes popword{0%{transform:scale(.2);opacity:0}30%{transform:scale(1.25);opacity:1}100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:1}}
.prompt{font-size:clamp(23px,3vw,30px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.35;margin:5px 0 12px}
#holder{font-size:19px;color:#9bf8dc;font-weight:750}
#message{color:#ffda98;min-height:25px;margin:12px 0 4px;font-size:14px}
#feedback{color:#9bedda;font-size:14px;min-height:24px}
.review{background:#193f52;border-radius:15px;padding:18px;margin-top:18px}
.teamrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #31596e;border-radius:12px;margin:8px 0}
.teamrow.active{border-color:#8bf3d6;background:#1b4c55}.teamrow.out{opacity:.4}
.lives{color:#ffb7ad;white-space:nowrap}.teamname{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.chip{display:inline-block;background:#244f65;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 10px;margin:4px;font-size:12px}
#used{max-height:150px;overflow:auto}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #31556a;margin:20px 0}
@media(max-width:700px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.card{padding:18px}main{padding:17px 10px}.arena{margin-left:-4px;margin-right:-4px}header{align-items:flex-start}.pill{font-size:11px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<header><div><div class="tag">Think fast · Pass the puffer</div><h1>APES Puffer Party</h1></div><span class="pill">10-second fuse</span></header>

<section id="setup" class="grid">
<div class="card">
<h2>Take your place in the reef.</h2>
<p>Give a valid APES answer to send the puffer swimming to the next team. If it bursts while your team holds it, you lose a life.</p>
<label for="names">Teams or players — one per line, 2–8 total</label>
<textarea id="names">Team Mangrove
Team Coyote
Team Coral
Team Redwood</textarea>
<label for="unit">Question pool</label>
<select id="unit">
<option value="all">All APES units</option>
<option value="1">Unit 1 · Ecosystems</option>
<option value="2">Unit 2 · Biodiversity</option>
<option value="3">Unit 3 · Populations</option>
<option value="4">Unit 4 · Earth systems</option>
<option value="5">Unit 5 · Land and water use</option>
<option value="6">Unit 6 · Energy</option>
<option value="7">Unit 7 · Air pollution</option>
<option value="8">Unit 8 · Aquatic and terrestrial pollution</option>
<option value="9">Unit 9 · Global change</option>
</select>
<label for="lives">Starting lives</label>
<select id="lives"><option>2</option><option selected>3</option><option>5</option></select>
<button class="full" id="start">Bring the teams into the reef →</button>
<p id="setupError" role="alert"></p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="hero" aria-hidden="true"><span>🐡</span></div>
<ol>
<li>Read the category before starting the fuse.</li>
<li>Type an answer and press Enter to pass.</li>
<li>Watch the puffer swim to the next team.</li>
<li>Use a new answer each turn within a round.</li>
<li>At 10 seconds: inflate, burst, lose a life!</li>
</ol>
<p class="help"><strong>The fuse lasts exactly 10 seconds per round.</strong> It keeps ticking during passes. Answers do not reset it or add time. The countdown is hidden.</p>
<p class="help">Teams share one device or classroom projector. The puffer shows whose turn it is. This version does not connect separate student devices.</p>
<p class="help">Answers use a curated bank. Pause for a teacher ruling if a scientifically valid answer is missing.</p>
<span class="pill" id="bankCount"></span>
</div>
</section>

<section id="play" class="hidden">
<div class="row spread">
<div class="row"><span class="pill" id="roundLabel"></span><span class="pill" id="unitLabel"></span><span class="pill">Fixed fuse · 10 seconds</span></div>
<button id="pause" class="secondary">Pause / teacher review</button>
</div>

<div class="arena">
<svg id="reef" viewBox="0 0 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Team circle. The puffer moves to the team whose turn it is.">
<defs>
<radialGradient id="fishColor" cx="35%" cy="25%"><stop stop-color="#ffecb4"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#e9ad48"/></radialGradient>
